Control of machining accuracy of CNC lathe in production News
The influence of CNC lathe machining accuracy is generally caused by the following several reasons, one is the equipment reason, the second is the tool problem, the third is programming, the fourth is the benchmark error, today Wally machinery technology and you briefly describe these aspects.
The machining accuracy of CNC lathe caused by equipment is generally caused by the system error of the machine itself and the error caused by the runout of the machine tool. In the process of using the machine tool, the core parts such as the lead screw are worn, resulting in the increase of the gap, and the greater the error of the machine tool, which will affect the machining accuracy of the CNC lathe;
In the process of NC lathe processing, it is very important to select the cutting tool. Unsuitable tool will lead to too high machine load and tool wear too fast, which will lead to the CNC lathe precision can not meet the product requirements;
The unreasonable cutting parameters set during programming is also one of the reasons that the machining accuracy of CNC lathe can not be guaranteed. The cutting parameters of feed and revolution must be set by combining the tool, material characteristics and equipment, so as to ensure the machining accuracy of CNC lathe;
In the process of NC lathe processing, the datum error of products is also one of the reasons that the machining accuracy of CNC lathe can not meet the requirements. Through the combination of turning and milling, the clamping times can be reduced as much as possible, which can reduce the influence of secondary processing on the machining accuracy of CNC lathe caused by the change of datum.
News - CNC precision parts processing should pay attention to what aspects
In the CNC precision hardware parts processing, the operator must pay attention to, can not be distracted, can not be tired operation, the machine is not stopped, can not enter the machine interior; the operator is not allowed to leave long hair, wear shoes, any impact on the safety of clothing are not allowed. 2、 Before machining CNC precision hardware parts, the equipment of the machining center should be inspected.
If there is any abnormal phenomenon, the machine must not be started up. 3、 Check the CNC precision hardware parts machining machine table, confirm that there is no foreign matter, start the power switch, start the processing operation.
5、 During the operation of the machine tool, the machine must be stopped immediately to check if the cutting amount is too large and the machine tool is overloaded. Before the problem is solved, it is not allowed to start the machine again.
