CNC lathe processing is much more complex than ordinary lathe, CNC lathe refers to the purpose of controlling machine tool through numerical control program, so as to carry out batch automatic processing operation, and has high precision, better efficiency in production, and also has the advantages of low labor intensity and high degree of automation. The following is the difference between ordinary lathe processing and numerical control lathe processing
The screw rod of trapezoidal thread is used in the ordinary lathe to process the thread, and the smooth rod is used for cutting and other processing technology. When CNC lathe is processing thread, the ball screw is usually used.
In terms of guide rail, the two lathes are also different. The rails of ordinary lathe are hard rails, while CNC lathes are wired rails in addition to hard rails.
In terms of motor configuration, there are big differences between the two lathes. The spindle motor of ordinary lathe can use ordinary motor, but if it is CNC lathe, the servo motor is usually used.
In addition, general lathe is not digital control operation, but CNC Lathe will have.
News - How to evaluate the accuracy of CNC machining center quotation when purchasing precision parts
There is no standard for reference in the quotation stage of template proofing. Different suppliers have different actual situations and different quoted prices.
Due to the special material or structure of the sample, customized tools are needed, resulting in the high cost of cutting tools;
If the structural surface of the sample appears curved surface or abnormal shape, it needs to run 3D or customized molding tools to complete, resulting in a long processing time, which is multiplied. Even if the sample development is successful, the cost of mass production is also unbearable;
There are also some other factors, such as no product drawings or 3D drawings, suppliers will spend more on production, and the quotation will be higher;
If the number of handpieces is limited and the supplier’s minimum start-up cost (time of machine adjustment + labor cost) is not met, it will be evenly distributed over the sample quantity, resulting in the phenomenon of high unit price. In the production of batch products, we can calculate whether the supplier’s quotation is accurate according to the processing time of the products.
Wally machinery technology provides detailed quotation scheme when quoting in CNC machining center. The quotation details include material cost, processing cost of each process, surface treatment fee, loss cost, profit, etc., and provides customers with reasonable processing scheme according to processing experience, so as to reduce the purchasing cost of customers.
