Application fields of mini excavators | ACE MACHINERY
Due to the advantages of small size and low initial capital investment, mini excavators are widely used in the fields of decoration, agriculture, animal husbandry and landscape in big cities. They are general purpose oils for small and medium engineering projects.
House decoration: The rotten holes in the wall must be removed during house decoration, and it is more efficient to use a micro excavator than a manual hammer. The mini excavator is relatively small in size and can go up and down stairs according to indoor stairs or even elevator cars.
Road expansion of self-built houses in rural areas: In the past, when self-built houses in rural areas were used, artificial foundation pits were required to excavate the foundations and trenches of the sewer pipes. Now, those jobs can be solved with small excavators, which not only eases the labor efficiency of workers, but also further improves the operation speed.
Tunnel construction: The small excavator has a very low aspect ratio and can be driven into some small and medium-sized tunnels for engineering construction. Some manufacturers have even developed electric mini excavators, which can better integrate into the natural environment of tunnel construction.
Landscape work: The natural environment of agricultural and animal husbandry landscape work is very narrow, and the surrounding area is often blocked by saplings and crops. In the maintenance of farming and animal husbandry gardens, it is impossible to make good use of large-scale machinery for digging and ditching, and micro excavators are just suitable.
Vegetable greenhouse digging: Vegetables in greenhouses are generally short, and large and medium-sized agricultural vehicles cannot work in it, so micro excavators are used for digging and ditching. It is said that micro excavators are widely used in vegetable greenhouses such as Shandong Province and Xi City.
Steel-making furnace slag cleaning: The key application of steel-making furnace or heating furnace weapons and equipment in iron-making plants is that a large amount of slag will be generated in the whole process of smelting. During the whole slag cleaning process, the micro excavator was often used to turn over the slag to clean the slag, and the working environment was extreme, which greatly tempered the driver and the excavator.
Hazardous work at heights: In news reports, we often see some small excavators working on cliffs, such as cliff construction or disaster relief work. The chassis of this excavator can be tilted to keep part of the cab level.
