It has two high-capacity chip evacuation grooves and a double-edged design, which not only has a good chip evacuation function, but also achieves a good tool balance. When processing medium and high-density boards, it does not turn black, does not smoke, and has a long service life.
It is recommended to use prismatic cutters for high-density boards and solid wood.
For metal mold processing milling cutter, tungsten steel milling cutter is recommended, and the surface is plated with purple black and hardened titanium.
