The spindle motor is hot. Solution: Check whether the water pump is working and whether the circulating water is lower than the standard liquid level.
The sound of the spindle motor is abnormal. Solution: Check whether the motor is overloaded; check whether there is a fault in the motor, and repair or replace if there is any.
The spindle motor is reversed. Solution: Check whether the motor line lacks phase and whether the output UVW terminal is confused.
